a/rutherford-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids shows September to October under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years on record since 1951. In 2025 the middle came in at 56% of normal for October to November and 36% for November to December. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 36% of normal on the middle, and April to May at 97%.</p>"}
